WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.925
Each separation technique uses a difference in a property.

2
00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:09.401
Water, salt, sand and iron: each tool uses a different property.

3
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.600
A magnet pulls out the iron, because it's magnetic.

4
00:00:20.568 --> 00:00:24.843
Filter paper keeps the sand: its grains are too big to pass.

5
00:00:29.249 --> 00:00:33.099
Evaporating the water leaves the dissolved salt behind.
